# w.lang.en/shards/list-frames: frames for lists, tasks, a shop and a wallet (reviewer block 2026-11-15 09:20, PSys2 Q18 K6): 32 frames bound to the acts and keys of the world schemas w.list and w.tasks ("add milk to my shopping list", "what is left to do", "I finished my homework", "how much do 3 pencils cost", "what is the change", "I start with 30 lei"), all with needs=entries; their role maps; and the lexicon of money words, derived from k.units.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository, own: tools/lang-en-list-frames.mjs; the money words derived from k.units, whose currencies come from CLDR 48 and hand-core 1)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/lang-en-list-frames.mjs

